{"seq":3,"slug":"release-hold-customs","title":"放行/查验/扣货处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-import-three-docs-match/customs-declare-receipt/release-hold-customs","wordCount":1781,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"放行-查验-扣货处置\">放行/查验/扣货处置</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>海关放行是顺利路径，但保税业务里还有三类高频异常分支：<strong>查验</strong>（海关要求实货核对）、<strong>扣货/扣留</strong>（货物被暂扣待处理）、以及<strong>退运/销毁</strong>（最终处置）。这三类分支的共同特征是：它们不由我方系统决定，而是海关或监管要求触发的，且<strong>处置周期长、涉及实物、需要跨部门协作</strong>。系统的职责不是「解决」它们，而是让它们<strong>可见、可控、可追溯</strong>——每一票异常都要有明确的责任人、明确的下一步、明确的时限。</p>\n<p>处置设计的核心是一个三段式：<strong>识别</strong>（从回执或人工录入中捕捉异常）→ <strong>建单</strong>（把异常变成一个带责任人和时限的工单）→ <strong>闭环</strong>（处置完成后回收状态，修正库存与账务）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[异常信号] --&gt; B[识别与分类]&#10;  B --&gt; C[建处置工单]&#10;  C --&gt; D[指派责任人/时限]&#10;  D --&gt; E[执行处置动作]&#10;  E --&gt; F{处置结果}&#10;  F --&gt;|放行| G[回填: 恢复出区流程]&#10;  F --&gt;|退运| H[回填: 账册还原, 通知用户退款]&#10;  F --&gt;|销毁| I[回填: 账册核销, 损失入账]&#10;  G --&gt; J[工单闭环]&#10;  H --&gt; J&#10;  I --&gt; J&#10;  J --&gt; K[写入不可变处置流水]\">graph TD\n  A[异常信号] --&gt; B[识别与分类]\n  B --&gt; C[建处置工单]\n  C --&gt; D[指派责任人/时限]\n  D --&gt; E[执行处置动作]\n  E --&gt; F{处置结果}\n  F --&gt;|放行| G[回填: 恢复出区流程]\n  F --&gt;|退运| H[回填: 账册还原, 通知用户退款]\n  F --&gt;|销毁| I[回填: 账册核销, 损失入账]\n  G --&gt; J[工单闭环]\n  H --&gt; J\n  I --&gt; J\n  J --&gt; K[写入不可变处置流水]</pre><h2 id=\"查验处置\">查验处置</h2><p>查验分两种触发方式：<strong>系统布控</strong>（海关风险模型命中，随回执告知）与<strong>人工抽检</strong>（现场随机）。前者在系统里有明确的回执信号，后者往往只能由现场人员录入。</p>\n<h3 id=\"查验对履约的影响与应对\">查验对履约的影响与应对</h3><p>查验意味着货不能立即出区，发货时效被拉长。系统要做的第一件事是<strong>阻止发货并通知用户</strong>，避免用户看到「已发货」却迟迟无物流。这里有一个产品判断：是延期通知还是主动退款？经验上，跨境电商的查验通常几日内完成，延迟通知加补偿比直接退款更优，但要在通知里给出可信的时间预期，而不是含糊的「请耐心等待」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"查验工单的字段\">查验工单的字段</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE inspection_ticket (&#10;  ticket_id      BIGINT GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  manifest_no    VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  order_no       VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL,&#10;  trigger_type   VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,   -- risk_control | manual_sample&#10;  customs_code   VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,&#10;  opened_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  sla_deadline   TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  assignee       VARCHAR(64) NULL,&#10;  state          VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;open&#39;,  -- open|inspecting|closed&#10;  outcome        VARCHAR(16) NULL,       -- released | held | returned | destroyed&#10;  closed_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NULL,&#10;  CONSTRAINT chk_outcome_when_closed CHECK (&#10;    (state = &#39;closed&#39; AND outcome IS NOT NULL) OR state &lt;&gt; &#39;closed&#39;&#10;  )&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_ticket_open ON inspection_ticket(sla_deadline) WHERE state &lt;&gt; &#39;closed&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inspection_ticket</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ticket_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GENERATED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ALWAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IDENTITY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  manifest_no    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_no       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trigger_type   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- risk_control | manual_sample</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  customs_code   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  opened_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sla_deadline   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  assignee       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'open'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- open|inspecting|closed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  outcome        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- released | held | returned | destroyed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  closed_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chk_outcome_when_closed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'closed'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outcome </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'closed'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_ticket_open</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inspection_ticket(sla_deadline) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'closed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>idx_ticket_open</code> 是一个部分索引，只为未闭环工单建索引，让「查所有超期未闭环的查验」这个最高频的运营查询保持高效。<code>sla_deadline</code> 是工单的时限，配合一个定时扫描即可产出超期告警。</p>\n<h3 id=\"查验的时限管理\">查验的时限管理</h3><p>设工单开启时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、时限为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，则剩余时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = t_0 + D - t_{now}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时工单超期，应升级告警。时限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 应按监管场所与商品类别分别设定，因为不同场所的查验效率差异很大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"扣货与扣留处置\">扣货与扣留处置</h2><p>扣留是比查验更严重的状态——货物被海关暂扣，等待进一步处理（补证、处罚、或解除）。扣留的处置链条明显更长，涉及法务与关务，但它同样必须在系统里落成明确的状态与工单，否则会变成「孤儿货物」：库里有货、账上有数、没人负责。</p>\n<h3 id=\"扣留的三种走向\">扣留的三种走向</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>走向</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>系统动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解除扣留</td>\n<td>补证齐全或核查无违规</td>\n<td>恢复出区流程，工单闭环</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退运出境</td>\n<td>不允许进口</td>\n<td>账册还原，订单退款，物流安排退运</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>销毁</td>\n<td>禁限类或无法退运</td>\n<td>账册核销，损失入账，税务处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>退运这一走向特别需要注意<strong>账册还原</strong>：货从未真正出区（法律上仍属未进口），因此之前为出区做的预扣分录要被冲销，而不是记一笔正常出库。如果误记为正常出库，账册结存会与实物不符。第 1 章的预扣/转正/释放两阶段模式在这里正好派上用场——退运对应「释放预扣」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与用户的关系处理\">与用户的关系处理</h3><p>扣留对用户是坏消息，处理方式直接影响体验与投诉率。工程上要保证的是<strong>信息透明与退款及时</strong>：一旦判定为退运或销毁，应立即启动退款流程，并明确告知原因（在合规允许的范围内）。同时要释放该订单占用的个人年度额度——虽然货未放行，但如果不释放，用户会因为「额度已用」而无法重新购买，这是最容易被漏掉的补偿动作。额度规则见 <a href=\"../import-mode-bonded/bonded-quota-purchase-limit\">个人额度/单次限额与商品范围</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"处置闭环与账务回填\">处置闭环与账务回填</h2><p>工单闭环不是「把状态改成 closed」这么简单，它必须携带账务回填：库存怎么变、额度怎么释放、钱怎么退。把这三个动作绑在闭环上，能防止「工单关了但账没平」这种最难查的差异。这里涉及的账务动作沿用本 hub 一贯的复式记账思路——每一次变动都记一笔等额反方向的分录，而不是直接改写余额 (<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Double-entry_bookkeeping\">Wikipedia: Double-entry bookkeeping</a>)。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant W as 处置工单&#10;  participant L as 账册服务&#10;  participant Q as 额度服务&#10;  participant R as 退款服务&#10;  W-&gt;&gt;L: 提交处置结果(released|returned|destroyed)&#10;  L-&gt;&gt;L: 按结果记分录(转正/释放/核销)&#10;  L--&gt;&gt;W: 账册已回填&#10;  W-&gt;&gt;Q: 释放额度冻结&#10;  Q--&gt;&gt;W: 已释放&#10;  W-&gt;&gt;R: 若需退款则发起(带幂等键)&#10;  R--&gt;&gt;W: 退款受理&#10;  W-&gt;&gt;W: state=closed, outcome 已写\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant W as 处置工单\n  participant L as 账册服务\n  participant Q as 额度服务\n  participant R as 退款服务\n  W-&gt;&gt;L: 提交处置结果(released|returned|destroyed)\n  L-&gt;&gt;L: 按结果记分录(转正/释放/核销)\n  L--&gt;&gt;W: 账册已回填\n  W-&gt;&gt;Q: 释放额度冻结\n  Q--&gt;&gt;W: 已释放\n  W-&gt;&gt;R: 若需退款则发起(带幂等键)\n  R--&gt;&gt;W: 退款受理\n  W-&gt;&gt;W: state=closed, outcome 已写</pre><p>顺序很关键：<strong>账册 → 额度 → 退款</strong>。账册先动，因为它决定实物与法律账的关系；额度释放必须先于退款成功，否则用户在退款到账前仍无法重下；退款最后，因为它有幂等键保护，可以安全重试。如果顺序颠倒（先退款后释放额度），会出现「钱退了但额度没放」的窗口期。</p>\n<h3 id=\"处置流水的不可变性\">处置流水的不可变性</h3><p>所有处置动作都要写入一条只追加的流水表，记录谁在什么时候做了什么决定、依据什么。这是审计追踪的基础，也是争议时唯一的证据来源。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE disposal_log (&#10;  log_id      BIGINT GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  ticket_id   BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES inspection_ticket(ticket_id),&#10;  action      VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,   -- assign|inspect|release|return|destroy|refund&#10;  operator    VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL,&#10;  detail      JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;{}&#39;::jsonb,&#10;  acted_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_disposal_ticket ON disposal_log(ticket_id, acted_at);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> disposal_log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  log_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GENERATED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ALWAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IDENTITY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ticket_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inspection_ticket(ticket_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- assign|inspect|release|return|destroy|refund</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  operator    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  detail      JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::jsonb,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  acted_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_disposal_ticket</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> disposal_log(ticket_id, acted_at);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这张表只允许 <code>INSERT</code>，不允许 <code>UPDATE</code>/<code>DELETE</code>，权限上也应如此配置。必要时可通过数据库触发器或只授予插入权限来强制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"异常处置的运营指标\">异常处置的运营指标</h2><p>处置流程是否健康，可以看三个指标：<strong>异常率</strong>（异常票数 / 总申报票数）、<strong>处置时长</strong>（从建单到闭环的中位时长）、<strong>超期率</strong>（超期闭环数 / 总闭环数）。这三个指标分别反映风险暴露、流程效率与执行力。</p>\n<p>异常率突然升高通常不是运营问题而是数据问题——可能是归类口径变了、某批次商品成分异常、或三单规则放宽导致不该申报的进来了。因此异常率要与三单判定结果、清单版本变更这些上游事件关联分析，而不是孤立看待。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>查验、扣货、退运、销毁是海关触发的异常分支，系统职责是让它们可见、可控、可追溯，而非「解决」它们。</li>\n<li>查验要先阻止发货并给出可信的延期通知，工单带 SLA 与部分索引以支撑超期告警。</li>\n<li>扣留的三种走向（解除、退运、销毁）对应不同的账册动作；退运对应「释放预扣」而非正常出库。</li>\n<li>退运或销毁时立即退款并释放个人年度额度——后者最易被漏掉，会阻塞用户重下。</li>\n<li>闭环必须携带账务回填，顺序是账册 → 额度 → 退款，防止「工单关了但账没平」。</li>\n<li>处置流水只追加、不可改，是审计追踪与争议取证的唯一依据。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>处置闭环涉及的账册动作与三向对账，见 <a href=\"../bonded-tax-settlement/bonded-reconcile-audit\">保税库存/税款对账与审计</a>；异常导致的退货与税款冲减，见 <a href=\"../bonded-tax-settlement/tax-collect-remit-customs\">代收代缴与对海关结算</a>；承载这些回执的状态机，见 <a href=\"customs-receipt-status\">海关回执与清关状态机</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"放行/查验/扣货处置","id":"放行-查验-扣货处置"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"查验处置","id":"查验处置"},{"level":3,"text":"查验对履约的影响与应对","id":"查验对履约的影响与应对"},{"level":3,"text":"查验工单的字段","id":"查验工单的字段"},{"level":3,"text":"查验的时限管理","id":"查验的时限管理"},{"level":2,"text":"扣货与扣留处置","id":"扣货与扣留处置"},{"level":3,"text":"扣留的三种走向","id":"扣留的三种走向"},{"level":3,"text":"与用户的关系处理","id":"与用户的关系处理"},{"level":2,"text":"处置闭环与账务回填","id":"处置闭环与账务回填"},{"level":3,"text":"处置流水的不可变性","id":"处置流水的不可变性"},{"level":2,"text":"异常处置的运营指标","id":"异常处置的运营指标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"海关回执与清关状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-import-three-docs-match/customs-declare-receipt/customs-receipt-status"},"next":{"title":"跨境电商综合税计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-import-three-docs-match/bonded-tax-settlement/cross-border-composite-tax"}}